#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "56_Chigusa"
msgid "I have to thank you, Kiryu-san. If I hadn't met you today, I\\r\nmight never have come to terms with Yusaku's death."
msgstr "Tengo que darte las gracias, Kiryu. Si hoy no te hubiera\\r\nconocido puede que nuncha hubiera aceptado la muerte\\r\nde Yusaku."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "68_Kiryu"
msgid "Hey, you finally called me by the right name."
msgstr "Hey, al fin acertaste mi nombre."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "80_Chigusa"
msgid "Yeah... Yeah, I guess I did. I really put you through a lot\\r\ntoday, huh?"
msgstr "Sí... sí, supongo que sí. Realmente hice que la pasaras\\r\nmal hoy, eh?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "92_Kiryu"
msgid "What, that? It was nothing."
msgstr "¿Qué, eso? No fue nada."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "104_Chigusa"
msgid "...Thank you, though. You're an amazing person, Kiryu-san.\\r\nI might even fall for you if I'm not careful."
msgstr "... De todas formas, gracias. Eres una persona increíble,\\r\nKiryu. Si me descuido podría hasta enamorarme de ti."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "116_Chigusa"
msgid "Oh, wait! I still have those engagement rings from earlier.\\r\nWill you marry me, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr "¡Ah, espera! Todavía tengo esos anillos de compromiso.\\r\n¿Te quieres casar conmigo, Kiryu?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "128_Kiryu"
msgid "Uh..."
msgstr "Eh..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "140_Chigusa"
msgid "Haha, just kidding! Another little lie, sorry. You didn't\\r\nbelieve me, did you?"
msgstr "¡Ja ja, era broma! Otra pequeña mentira, perdón. No\\r\nte lo habrás creído, ¿no?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "164_Kiryu"
msgid "*sigh*"
msgstr "*suspiro*"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176_Chigusa"
msgid "Even so... I want you to have these. I don't need them\\r\nanymore."
msgstr "Aún así... quiero que te quedes esto. Ya no los\\r\nnecesito."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "212_Kiryu"
msgid "Are you sure?"
msgstr "Tú..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "224_Chigusa"
msgid "Yeah. Yusaku gave me something far more important than\\r\nthese rings today."
msgstr "Sí. Yusaku hoy me dio algo mucho más importante que\\r\nestos anillos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "236_Chigusa"
msgid "And it's not just that. If I hang onto them... I don't think\\r\nI'll ever find the strength to move on."
msgstr "Y no solo eso. Si me los quedo... no creo que vuelva\\r\na encontrar la fuerza para pasar página."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "248_Kiryu"
msgid "All right. I'd be honored to take care of them for you."
msgstr "De acuerdo. Será un honor cuidarlos por ti."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "260_Chigusa"
msgid "Well, I should be going. Goodbye, Kiryu-san."
msgstr "Bueno, debería irme. Adiós, Kiryu."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "284_Kiryu"
msgid "Maybe sometimes lying is the right thing to do..."
msgstr "Puede que a veces mentir sea lo correcto..."

